{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a2091"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge art/painting","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/zz-r2-art__painting.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",856],["+","When she left New York in 1947 and her contract with him ran out, Pollock, by then known for his drip and streak paintings poured onto canvases laid on the floor, applied for a fellowship from the John Simon Guggenheim Memorial Foundation, set up by her uncle Simon Guggenheim – and was turned down. "],["=",169]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",852],["+","Als sie 1947 New York verließ und ihr Vertrag mit ihm auslief, bewarb sich Pollock, inzwischen für seine Tropf- und Schlierenbilder auf am Boden liegenden Leinwänden bekannt, um ein Stipendium der von ihrem Onkel Simon Guggenheim gegründeten John Simon Guggenheim Memorial Foundation – und wurde abgelehnt. "],["=",165]]}]},
